      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": { "character": "guardian", "expression": "explain", "position": "right" },
      "text": "去人间。去一个会成为你家的地方。家是你哭的时候，有人愿意抱住你；也是你走远以后，还有一盏灯愿意为你亮着的地方。",
      "next": "cloud_005"
    },
    "cloud_005": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "confused", "position": "left" },
      "text": "那我要怎么找到它？如果我选错了怎么办？",
      "next": "cloud_006"
    },
    "cloud_006": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-heaven.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": { "character": "guardian", "expression": "smile", "position": "right" },
      "text": "真正属于你的家，不会只用眼睛看见。它会在你靠近的时候，让你怀里的星星变暖。",
      "next": "archive_001"
    },
    "archive_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "第一章 星星档案馆",
      "background": "bg-archive.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "云阶尽头，是一座没有屋顶的图书馆。无数颗星星像书一样排在空中，每一颗星星里，都藏着一个家的故事。",
      "next": "archive_002"
    },
