      "text": "最后一扇观察窗亮得很慢。窗后只是一个普通的夜晚。一盏小灯亮在桌边，桌上有几张纸，一支笔，一件叠得不太整齐的小衣服。",
      "next": "warm_002"
    },
    "warm_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "confused", "position": "left" },
      "text": "这里……好普通。可是我靠近的时候，心里突然安静了。像是有人把声音放轻了，怕吵到我。",
      "next": "warm_003"
    },
    "warm_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": { "character": "guardian", "expression": "explain", "position": "right" },
      "text": "那就仔细看。真正的等待，常常藏在最普通的地方。",
      "next": "warm_game"
    },
    "warm_game": {
      "type": "minigame",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "game": "warm_clues",
      "successNext": "warm_004"
    },
    "warm_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "小夜灯、名字纸条、小衣服、模糊相框……他们还没见过我，可我好像已经被他们想念了。",
      "next": "warm_005"
    },
    "warm_005": {
      "type": "choice",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "worried", "position": "left" },
      "text": "我的星星好暖。可是我还不知道，能不能说：我想去这里。",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "我想再靠近一点。", "cost": { "stardust": 1 }, "set": { "belonging": 1 }, "next": "warm_gift" },
        { "text": "这盏灯好像在等我。", "cost": { "stardust": 1 }, "set": { "belonging": 2 }, "next": "warm_gift" }
      ]
    },
    "warm_gift": {
      "type": "gacha",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "pool": "warm_pool",
      "set": { "warm_done": 1 },
      "next": "home_map"
    },
    "xingyu_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "第七章 同一盏灯前",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "就在小天使想伸手触碰那扇观察窗的时候，另一只手，也轻轻碰到了同一片星光。",
      "next": "xingyu_002"
    },
    "xingyu_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "xingyu",
      "sprite": { "character": "xingyu", "expression": "quiet", "position": "right" },
      "text": "等一下。这盏灯……我也看见了。",
      "next": "xingyu_003"
    },
    "xingyu_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "worried", "position": "left" },
      "text": "你也想去这个家吗？",
      "next": "xingyu_004"
    },
    "xingyu_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "xingyu",
      "sprite": { "character": "xingyu", "expression": "sad", "position": "right" },
      "text": "嗯。那里很暖。如果我去了，他们也会爱我吗？我不是想抢，我只是也想被那样等着。",
      "next": "xingyu_choice"
    },
    "xingyu_choice": {
      "type": "choice",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "serious", "position": "left" },
      "text": "小天使低头看着自己的星星。它很暖，却也变得有点沉。",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "先听星羽说完。", "set": { "kindness": 1 }, "next": "trial_intro" },
        { "text": "我也想去，但我不想抢。", "set": { "honest": 1 }, "next": "trial_intro" },
        { "text": "问守护天使：怎么办？", "set": { "rule_asked": 1 }, "next": "trial_intro" }
      ]
    },
    "trial_intro": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "guardian",
      "sprite": { "character": "guardian", "expression": "explain", "position": "right" },
      "text": "心愿之门不是用来抢夺的。它会听见真正相连的缘分。你们都可以听，都可以看，都可以回应。",
      "next": "trial_wait_game"
    },
    "trial_wait_game": {
      "type": "minigame",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "game": "trial_waiting",
      "successNext": "trial_wait_after"
    },
    "trial_wait_after": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "是这一句。它不是最漂亮的话，可我听见的时候，星星像被抱住了一下。",
      "next": "trial_detail_game"
    },
    "trial_detail_game": {
      "type": "minigame",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "game": "trial_details",
      "successNext": "trial_detail_after"
    },
    "trial_detail_after": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "xingyu",
      "sprite": { "character": "xingyu", "expression": "quiet", "position": "right" },
      "text": "我记得那盏灯很暖。可是这些细节……好像是你一直在记住。",
      "next": "trial_response"
    },
    "trial_response": {
      "type": "choice",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "serious", "position": "left" },
      "text": "最后一轮，不再选择卡片。小天使要回应那盏灯后的心愿。",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "我也选择了你们。", "cost": { "stardust": 8 }, "set": { "ending_a": 1, "gate_done": 1 }, "next": "trial_final_a" },
        { "text": "我想成为你们的孩子。", "cost": { "stardust": 8 }, "set": { "ending_b": 1, "gate_done": 1 }, "next": "trial_final_b" },
        { "text": "我会带着星星去见你们。", "cost": { "stardust": 8 }, "set": { "ending_c": 1, "gate_done": 1 }, "next": "trial_final_c" }
      ]
    },
    "trial_final_a": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "我也选择了你们。不是因为你们最耀眼，而是因为你们还没见到我，就已经把灯点亮了。",
      "next": "xingyu_bless"
    },
    "trial_final_b": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "我想成为你们的孩子。想在害怕的时候被抱住，想在摔倒的时候，听见你们说：再试一次。",
      "next": "xingyu_bless"
    },
    "trial_final_c": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "我会带着星星去见你们。如果有一天你们忘了今天的光，我就用笑声提醒你们。",
      "next": "xingyu_bless"
    },
    "xingyu_bless": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "xingyu",
      "sprite": { "character": "xingyu", "expression": "smile", "position": "right" },
      "text": "原来……有些光，是会叫名字的。它叫的是你。没关系，刚才我也听见了，在很远的另一边，也有一盏灯亮了起来。",
      "next": "ending_001"
    },
    "ending_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "终章 原来是你们",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "心愿之门缓缓打开。门后的房间终于变得清楚：小夜灯、名字纸条、小衣服，还有那张模糊的相框，都被星光一点一点照亮。",
      "next": "ending_002"
    },
    "ending_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "touched", "position": "left" },
      "text": "原来是他们。原来一直等我的，是他们。",
      "next": "ending_003"
    },
    "ending_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-warm.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "妈妈的声音轻轻传来：我希望她来到这个世界的时候，知道有人在等她。爸爸的声音也很轻：我们会慢慢学，不会一开始就什么都会，但会一直陪她长大。",
      "next": "ending_004"
    },
    "ending_004": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-gate.svg",
      "speaker": "little_angel",
      "sprite": { "character": "little_angel", "expression": "smile", "position": "center" },
      "text": "我选好了。我要去做他们的孩子。",
      "next": "birthday_001"
    },
    "birthday_001": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "chapter": "生日结尾",
      "background": "bg-cover.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "很多年以后，那个小天使长到了八岁。她也许不记得星星档案馆和心愿之门，但那一天的选择，一直藏在她的笑声里。",
      "next": "birthday_002"
    },
    "birthday_002": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-cover.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "亲爱的宝贝，八岁生日快乐。你不是偶然来到这个家的。是很久以前，有一个小天使穿过星星，认真看过很多家的光，最后选择了我们。",
      "next": "birthday_003"
    },
    "birthday_003": {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "bg-cover.svg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "谢谢你成为我们的孩子，也谢谢你，让我们成为爸爸妈妈。愿你以后走到很远很远的地方，也永远知道：这个家，会一直为你亮着灯。",
      "next": "title"
    }
  }
}
